# ==============================================================================
# CHORD DIAGRAM BY SITE × COMPOUND
# TOP 10 MOST FREQUENT RESIDUES WITHIN EACH SITE × COMPOUND GROUP
# SPEARMAN CORRELATIONS + GROUP-SPECIFIC PCA LOADING RINGS
# ==============================================================================
#
# NEW ANALYTICAL RATIONALE
# ------------------------
# Every analysis is performed independently for each SITE × COMPOUND subset.
# No residue-contact information from one compound is pooled with another
# compound when calculating:
#
#   1. residue frequencies / Top 10 residues
#   2. Hellinger-transformed residue fingerprints
#   3. Spearman residue-residue correlations
#   4. Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction
#   5. PCA loadings and explained variance shown in the rings
#
# If the input contains 3 sites and 4 compounds in each site, 12 independent
# chord diagrams will be generated.
# ==============================================================================


